      "type": "code-review-finding",
      "source": "ppt-web-core review 2026-06-29",
      "score_delta": 1,
      "evidence": [
        "frontend/apps/ppt-web/src/lib/api.ts:180-217 \u2014 response interceptor fires onUnauthorizedCallback() on 401 but then rejects with transformError; it never attempts a token-refresh-and-retry. Combined with AuthContext.refreshToken() existing but not being wired into the axios instance, every 401 forces a hard logout/redirect instead of the documented refresh-once-retry pattern used by createAuthApi (@ppt/api-client). RETRYABLE_STATUS_CODES (line 76) excludes 401, so the retry branch can never recover an expired access token."
